","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"94f33153-db0e-11ef-9e8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"吴良，字大仪，齐国临淄县（今山东省淄博市临淄区）人，东汉经学传述人。","link_td_id":"Q10020220","link_td_number_id":6181917,"people_name":"吳良","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴良","people_xingming":"吴良","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"94f33154-db0e-11ef-9527-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-257,"link_death_year":-193,"link_td_description":"萧何，沛县（今中国江苏省沛县）人。是汉朝初年丞相、政治家。封爵酇侯，谥号文终，汉初三杰之一。辅助汉高祖刘邦建立汉政权。","link_td_id":"Q10000053","link_td_number_id":93952,"people_name":"蕭何","people_name_jianti_auto":"萧何","people_xingming":"萧何","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"94f33156-db0e-11ef-a575-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-231,"link_death_year":-196,"link_td_description":"韩信，淮阴人，西汉开国功臣，与张良、萧何并称为汉初三杰；又与彭越、英布并称为汉初三大名将。被后人称为“兵仙”。","link_td_id":"Q10000192","link_td_number_id":69222,"people_name":"韓信","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩信","people_xingming":"韩信","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"94f33157-db0e-11ef-ab9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"吴良，字大仪，齐国临淄县（今山东省淄博市临淄区）人，东汉经学传述人。","link_td_id":"Q10020220","link_td_number_id":6181917,"people_name":"良","people_name_jianti_auto":"良","people_xingming":"吴良","start_index":164,"tongjian_id":"94f50a63-db0e-11ef-8730-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊國","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐国","resolved_place_entity_id":1542,"start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"94f33155-db0e-11ef-9e8b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"6夏，四月，丙辰，詔曰：「方今上無天子，下無方伯，若涉淵水而無舟楫。夫萬乘至重而壯者慮輕，實賴有德左右小子。高密侯禹，元功之首；東平王蒼，寬博有謀；其以禹爲太傅，蒼爲驃騎將軍。」蒼懇辭，帝不許。又詔驃騎將軍置長史、掾史員四十人，位在三公上。蒼嘗薦西曹掾齊國吳良，帝曰：「薦賢助國，宰相之職也。蕭何舉韓信，設壇而拜，不復考試，今以良爲議郞。」","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月二十四日丙辰，汉明帝下诏说：“如今上无先帝，下无独当一面的重臣，如同涉渡深水却没有船和桨。皇帝之位极为重大，而朕正因年轻而思虑不周，实在需要依靠有德之人辅佐朕。高密侯邓禹，是元勋之首；东平王刘苍，宽厚博学而有谋略；特命邓禹为太傅，刘苍为骠骑将军。”刘苍恳切推辞，汉明帝没有应允。又下诏令骠骑将军府设置长史、掾史等属官四十人，使骠骑将军的地位在三公之上。刘苍曾推荐西曹掾齐国人吴良，汉明帝说：“推荐贤才辅助国家，是宰相的职责。萧何举荐韩信，汉高帝设坛拜他为将，不再另行考试，现今任命吴良为议郎。”","content_jianti_auto":"6夏，四月，丙辰，诏曰：「方今上无天子，下无方伯，若涉渊水而无舟楫。夫万乘至重而壮者虑轻，实赖有德左右小子。高密侯禹，元功之首；东平王苍，宽博有谋；其以禹为太傅，苍为骠骑将军。」苍恳辞，帝不许。又诏骠骑将军置长史、掾史员四十人，位在三公上。苍尝荐西曹掾齐国吴良，帝曰：「荐贤助国，宰相之职也。萧何举韩信，设坛而拜，不复考试，今以良为议郞。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3509,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94f33145-db0e-11ef-b6b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"無弋爰劒","people_name_jianti_auto":"无弋爰劒","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94f50a66-db0e-11ef-8c95-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"硏","people_name_jianti_auto":"硏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94f50a67-db0e-11ef-9a3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"硏","people_name_jianti_auto":"硏","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"94f50a68-db0e-11ef-9037-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"燒當","people_name_jianti_auto":"烧当","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"94f50a69-db0e-11ef-aa1b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇良","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇良","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6a-db0e-11ef-9aa7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"燒當","people_name_jianti_auto":"烧当","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6b-db0e-11ef-b54e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"燒當","people_name_jianti_auto":"烧当","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6c-db0e-11ef-8580-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇良","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇良","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6d-db0e-11ef-af55-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"滇良","people_name_jianti_auto":"滇良","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6e-db0e-11ef-af41-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94f50a6f-db0e-11ef-a436-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"湟中","place_name_jianti_auto":"湟中","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"94f50a70-db0e-11ef-b